<title>USA: 360 Communications files $500 mln debt shelf.</title>
<headline>360 Communications files $500 mln debt shelf.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>360 Communications Co filed a shelf registration statement with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission to offer up to $500 million in debt securities and debt securities warrants.</p>
<p>The wireless communications company said the proceeds would be available for general corporate purposes and may be used to repay short-term debt and borrowings, to fund future acquisitions, for capital expenditures and working capital.</p>
</text>
